{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"019f63c7-db85-76a3-a707-8417c7932c43","team_id":"contest2026_110_hahaha","github_login":"xjx","tool":"codex","seq":357,"ts":"2026-07-15T15:01:08.299Z","role":"assistant","model":"gpt-5.4","text":"最直接的是用共享目录，或者用 `scp`/拖拽把文件拿到 Windows。\n\n如果你是 `VMware`：\n1. 在虚拟机关机状态下开启 `Shared Folders`。\n2. 选一个 Windows 目录共享给 Ubuntu，比如 `D:\\vm-share`。\n3. Ubuntu 里一般会出现在 `/mnt/hgfs/` 下。\n4. 执行：\n```bash\ncp /home/xjx/vendor/allwinnertech/lichee/out/r528s3/gemini-s1_nand/rtos_nuttx_r528s3-gemini-s1_uart0_128Mnand.img /mnt/hgfs/vm-share/\n```\n\n如果你是 `VirtualBox`：\n1. 安装 `Guest Additions`。\n2. 配置共享目录，比如 `D:\\vm-share`。\n3. Ubuntu 里通常挂载到 `/media/sf_vm-share/`。\n4. 执行：\n```bash\ncp /home/xjx/vendor/allwinnertech/lichee/out/r528s3/gemini-s1_nand/rtos_nuttx_r528s3-gemini-s1_uart0_128Mnand.img /media/sf_vm-share/\n```\n\n如果共享目录没配，也可以在 Ubuntu 里开个临时 HTTP/SSH 传输：\n```bash\ncd /home/xjx/vendor/allwinnertech/lichee/out/r528s3/gemini-s1_nand\npython3 -m http.server 8000\n```\n然后在 Windows 浏览器里访问 `http://虚拟机IP:8000/` 下载这个 `.img`。\n\n镜像文件就是：\n`/home/xjx/vendor/allwinnertech/lichee/out/r528s3/gemini-s1_nand/rtos_nuttx_r528s3-gemini-s1_uart0_128Mnand.img`\n\n如果你告诉我你用的是 `VMware`、`VirtualBox` 还是 `Hyper-V`，我可以直接给你对应的最短步骤。"}
